# Google Drive content is synced directly into the repo root (/workspace) and
# must NEVER be committed. Ignore everything at the root by default, then
# explicitly allow the project's own tracked files below.
/*

# Project files that ARE part of the repo (add new tracked root files here):
!/.gitignore
!/.cursor/
!/README.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/scripts/

# (defense in depth) never commit credential material
*.sa.json
service-account*.json
